      "id": "claim_3b7b8c1f6b1e4351a7240badad6d1b40",
      "statement": "The API container's entrypoint (apps/api/entrypoint.sh, the ENTRYPOINT of Dockerfile.api) defaults DIRECT_URL to DATABASE_URL and runs 'npx prisma migrate deploy --schema=packages/db-client/prisma/schema.prisma' before exec'ing node apps/api/dist/index.js; without DATABASE_URL it skips migrations and runs in catalog-only mode, keeping the published image self-contained against a fresh database.",
