    {
      "id": "claim_d77c62e3004b4394917be873279b8eba",
      "statement": "Route handler bodies are each wrapped in try/catch that logs and returns a domain-specific 500 code instead of propagating: DB_ERROR for datasheet and roster routes, UPLOAD_ERROR for media upload, DELETE_ERROR for media delete, and AUDIT_ERROR for the audit route; consequently the global INTERNAL_ERROR handler mostly fires only for middleware-level or unguarded failures.",
