      "id": "claim_221c022bf31b4f33bda280f45b39b48b",
      "statement": "Catalog read endpoints are public with no auth (security: [] in the OpenAPI spec): GET /datasheets with factionId, role (mapped to battlefieldRole), page (default 1) and limit (default 50) returning name-ascending pages plus meta { page, totalPages, totalCount }; GET /datasheets/:id adding bodyguardsFor with 404 NOT_FOUND on unknown id; GET /stratagems with phase/category/detachmentId filters; GET /weapons full registry; GET /changelog.",
