    {
      "id": "claim_bf0bbd6c41b8403ca582b10c36e3cb47",
      "statement": "The API has no test suite of its own: apps/api/package.json defines no test script and its lint script is just 'tsc --noEmit'. API behavior is asserted only indirectly, through the web Playwright flows in apps/web/e2e/critical-flows.spec.ts (run on push/PR to main via .github/workflows/e2e.yml) and CI typecheck/build gates (turbo run test build in .gitlab-ci.yml), so API-only regressions such as changed error codes are not caught by CI.",
      "evidence": [
