      "id": "claim_0bef76f056e6474ab1fec9ee17007ba7",
      "statement": "The JWT `sub` requirements documented in docs/API.md (must be a UUID, must reference a pre-existing user_profiles row) are enforced only by the database, not by requireAuth; a well-signed token for an unprovisioned sub therefore surfaces from roster route handlers' catch blocks as 500 DB_ERROR rather than a 4xx client error.",
