      "statement": "docker-compose.prod.yml runs the same self-migrating API image from GHCR (forceorg-api:${FORCEORG_TAG:-latest}) behind the entrypoint, gated on a healthy Postgres, and boots with zero configuration using deliberately public placeholders: JWT_SECRET defaults to 'please-change-me' and AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID/AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY default to empty strings, which its header states must be overridden before any real deployment or network exposure.",
